# Bridge/heartbeat timing constants (Task 1.4): race windows and retry cadences
# previously hand-duplicated as bare floats across bridge.py, bridge_heartbeat.py,
# bridge_reload_state.py and phantom_cleaner.py. One generated row replaces them.
#
# startupGraceS: time to let Unity come up before BridgeState -> FAILED (bridge.py).
# domainReloadExpiryS: must stay >= startupGraceS (bridge_reload_state.py comment).
# backoffMinS / backoffMaxS: exponential reconnect-backoff bounds (bridge_heartbeat.py).
# reloadBackoffS: fast reconnect backoff for expected domain reloads (PlayMode enter/exit).
# orphanCheckIntervalS (DEV-54): yield cadence of the orphan-parent check loop, so it
#   does not starve other coroutines while waiting out the orphan grace period.
# busyTickS / idleTickS (C1 #11 follow-up): _tick_disconnected per-branch poll cadence
#   while Unity is busy/idle.
# probeGraceS (C1 #11): a failed tcp_probe must persist this long (clearing Unity's
#   worst-case same-port bind-retry window, ~12.6s) before a port file is swept.
RECORD Timing COUNT 1
  startupGraceS: number
  domainReloadExpiryS: number
  backoffMinS: number
  backoffMaxS: number
  reloadBackoffS: number
  orphanCheckIntervalS: number
  busyTickS: number
  idleTickS: number
  probeGraceS: number
END
